# Portfolio Content Map

## One-Line Claim

> **I build functional web applications that turn ideas and real problems into usable solutions.**

---

## Main Action

> **Get in touch about an opportunity to work together.**

The main purpose of my portfolio is to demonstrate my skills and projects to potential employers and create opportunities to work with them.

---

# Content Map

## 🏠 Home Page

### Sections

1. **Hero Section**
   - My name
   - One-line claim
   - Short introduction
   - Primary CTA

2. **Featured Work**
   - My strongest project first
   - Selected major projects

3. **What I Do**
   - Build functional web applications
   - Develop user interfaces
   - Solve practical problems through software

4. **Skills & Technologies**
   - Technologies and tools I actually use

5. **About Preview**
   - Short introduction about me and my work

6. **Contact Section**
   - Final invitation to connect

### Featured Cases

1. **Strongest completed project**
2. **SafeBite**
3. **Construction Cost Estimator — In Progress**

### CTA

> **View My Work**

